#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:8
msgid "Prerequisites and hosting"
msgstr "Predpogoji in gostovanje"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:10
msgid "To install Galette, you will need to meet the following requirements :"
msgstr "Za namestitev Galette morate izpolnjevati naslednje zahteve:"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:12
msgid "a web server (like Apache),"
msgstr "spletni strežnik (kot je Apache),"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:13
msgid "PHP 8.3 or more recent,"
msgstr "PHP 8.3 ali novejši,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:15
msgid ""
"`ctype`, `dom`, `fileinfo`, `filter`, `gd`, `gettext`, `iconv`, `intl`, "
"`mbstring` and `session`,"
msgstr ""
"`ctype`, `dom`, `fileinfo`, `filter`, `gd`, `gettext`, `iconv`, `intl`, "
"`mbstring` in `session`,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:16
msgid "`PDO`, with `pdo_mysql` or `pdo_pgsql` depending on your database,"
msgstr "`PDO`, s `pdo_mysql` ali `pdo_pgsql`, odvisno od vaše zbirke podatkov,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:17
msgid ""
"`curl` and `openssl` are recommended, but not required (`curl` is for "
"example used to call a :ref:`post contribution script <man_preferences>` "
"over HTTP)."
msgstr ""
"`curl` in `openssl` sta priporočljiva, vendar nista obvezna ('curl` se na "
"primer uporablja za klic :ref:`skripta prispevka za objavo <man_preferences>"
"` prek HTTP)."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:19
msgid ""
"A database server, `MariaDB <https://mariadb.org>`_ 10.5 minimum (or MySQL "
"8.0 minimum), or `PostgreSQL <https://postgresql.org>`_ 13 minimum."
msgstr ""
"Strežnik podatkovnih baz, `MariaDB <https://mariadb.org>`_ najmanj 10.5 (ali "
"MySQL najmanj 8.0) ali `PostgreSQL <https://postgresql.org>`_ najmanj 13."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:21
msgid ""
"A recent web browser with Javascript enabled is also required to use Galette."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo Galette potrebujete novejši spletni brskalnik z omogočenim "
"Javascriptom."

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:23
msgid ""
"Galette is tested continuously with recent versions of these components. If "
"you encounter issues with a recent version, please let us know ;)"
msgstr ""
"Galette se nenehno testira z novejšimi različicami teh komponent. Če "
"naletite na težave z novejšo različico, nam to sporočite ;)"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:25
msgid "Galette does not work on the following hostings:"
msgstr "Galette ne deluje na naslednjih gostovanjih:"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:27
msgid "Free,"
msgstr "Brezplačno,"

#: ../installation/prerequis.rst:28
msgid "Olympe Networks."
msgstr "Olympe Networks."

#~ msgid "`gd` PHP module,"
#~ msgstr "PHP modul `gd`,"

#~ msgid "`PDO` module and `mysql` ou `postgresql` for PDO,"
#~ msgstr "Modul `PDO` in `mysql` ali `postgresql` za PDO,"

#~ msgid "`curl` PHP module,"
#~ msgstr "PHP modul `curl`,"

#~ msgid "`intl` PHP module,"
#~ msgstr "PHP modul `intl`,"

#~ msgid "SSL support,"
#~ msgstr "Podpora za SSL,"

#~ msgid "`gettext` PHP module (optional)."
#~ msgstr "PHP modul `gettext` (neobvezno)."
